OL,3,GNEWSAHairless chimp Jambo among four   
OL,4,Aapes to die at zoo                     
OL,6,FA zoo has announced the death of one of
OL,7,Fits most famous chimpanzees, as well as
OL,8,Fthree bonobos who had become unwell    
OL,9,Fwith a "flu-like respiratory illness". 
OL,11,FTwycross Zoo, on the                   
OL,12,FLeicestershire-Warwickshire border,    
OL,13,Fsaid members of the UK's only bonobo   
OL,14,Ftroop became unwell at the end of      
OL,15,FOctober and despite treatment, three   
OL,16,F"young members" passed away.           
OL,18,FIt added the zoo had also said goodbye 
OL,19,Fto Jambo, a 44-year-old male chimpanzee
OL,20,Fwhose health had deteriorated towards  
OL,21,Fthe end of his life, and a decision was
OL,22,Ftherefore made to euthanise him.       
